---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Why is an installed skill or tool missing?',
    a: 'Check that the suite and its capability are enabled. Skills may restrict manual invocation. MCP and LSP panels report missing credentials, dependencies and mount failures. Project-scoped MCP is not mounted.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Where do I configure MCP credentials?',
    a: 'Open the service in <strong>MCP services</strong>. Suite details are read-only previews. Missing references show <code>needs-credentials</code>; launch-environment credentials require an environment change and a DSH restart.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Which MCP transports are supported?',
    a: 'The built-in bridge supports stdio, Streamable HTTP with OAuth, and legacy SSE. Turning off MCP enhancement selects the optional host-client compatibility backend, without OAuth or SSE through this integration.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if a source download fails?',
    a: 'Use a local directory, adopt a manual checkout, or configure a proxy or mirror. See the <a href="https://github.com/Sivan757/dsh-agent-plugins-market/blob/main/docs/guides/usage.md#configure-marketplace-sources">source configuration guide</a>.',
  },
  {
    q: 'When do local edits become visible?',
    a: 'There is no file watcher. Local-source discovery caches results for up to 30 seconds; refresh the source to invalidate them. Project discovery has a separate five-second cache. An already-open page does not automatically refresh.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Does removing a source delete files?',
    a: 'Only when you tick <strong>also delete the managed market directory</strong> in the confirmation. That removes the checkout under <code>.sources/&lt;id&gt;</code> — including one you cloned yourself and adopted. A local-directory source pointing outside <code>.sources/</code> is never deleted.',
  },
];
---
<Base
  title="FAQ — dsh-agent-plugins-market for DeepSeek Harness"
  description="Frequently asked questions about using Claude Code, Codex, Cursor and Kimi plugins inside DeepSeek Harness with dsh-agent-plugins-market."
>
  <h1>FAQ</h1>
  {faqs.map((f) => (
    <div class="card">
      <h2 style="margin-top:0" id={f.q.toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]+/g, '-').slice(0, 60)}>{f.q}</h2>
      <div set:html={f.a} />
    </div>
  ))}
</Base>
